## Designer Baguette Rings (Zac Zac Posen): $1,498 to $4,365

[![Baguette emerald cut diamond ring double row pave designer zac zac posen](/images/baguette-emerald-cut-diamond-ring-double-row.avif)](https://www.bluenile.com/site-search/jewelry?Diamonds=Dia,Lab&ComponentIDs=Ring&stoneShape=baguette&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)

Zac Zac Posen's baguette ring collection pairs baguette-cut diamonds with pavé accents in multi-row and geometric layouts. The designs are more complex than pure channel baguette bands — more width, more visual interest, and more design specific to ZZP's aesthetic. Review counts are lower than the Dot Dash designs, but the styling is distinct.

**Baguette & Pavé Diamond Crown Curved Wedding Ring in 14k Yellow Gold (ZZP, 2mm, 3/8 ct. tw.) — [$1,498](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/rings/zac-zac-posen-baguette-pave-diamond-crown-curved-wedding-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-2-mm-3-8-ct-tw-item-192910?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (9 reviews, sale from $2,140)

The entry ZZP design — 30% discount from original price. A curved wedding band with a crown-shaped baguette accent at the center. At 2mm width, it sits flat and minimal on the finger.

Works as a wedding band enhancer around an engagement ring because the curved profile is designed to curve around a center stone.

**Double Row Baguette & Pavé Diamond Wedding Ring in 14k White Gold (ZZP, 3mm, 3/8 ct. tw.) — [$2,010](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/rings/zac-zac-posen-double-row-baguette-pave-diamond-wedding-ring-in-14k-white-gold-3-mm-3-8-ct-tw-item-193054?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (12 reviews)

12 reviews — the most reviewed ZZP design in this lineup. Two rows of alternating baguette and pavé diamonds at 3mm width. The double row adds presence without dramatic width.

In white gold, the two-row pattern reads as a refined, architectural band — more complex than a single-row design without going into statement territory.

**Double Row Baguette & Pavé Diamond Wedding Ring in 14k Yellow Gold (ZZP, 3mm, 3/8 ct. tw.) — [$2,140](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/rings/zac-zac-posen-double-row-baguette-pave-diamond-wedding-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-3-mm-3-8-ct-tw-item-193053?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (12 reviews)

Same double row design in yellow gold. The warm metal gives the baguette accents a vintage character — the ZZP double row in yellow gold pairs well with a rose gold or yellow gold emerald cut ring as a statement stack.

[![Baguette emerald cut diamond ring east west single baguette zac zac posen](/images/baguette-emerald-cut-diamond-ring-east-west.avif)](https://www.bluenile.com/site-search/jewelry?Diamonds=Dia,Lab&ComponentIDs=Ring&stoneShape=baguette&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)

**East West Single Baguette Diamond Ring in 14k Yellow Gold (ZZP, 2.6mm, 1/6 ct. tw.) — [$2,140](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/rings/east-west-single-baguette-diamond-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-26-mm-1-6-ct-tw-by-zac-zac-posen-item-191990?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (4 reviews)

A single large baguette diamond set horizontally (east-west) at the center of a plain band. The east-west orientation rotates the baguette 90 degrees — the long axis runs across the finger rather than along it. This makes the single baguette visible as a horizontal bar, referencing the architectural character of step-cut stones in a ring design you don't see often.

**Triple Row East-West Baguette & Pavé Diamond Wedding Ring in 14k White Gold (ZZP, 6mm, 3/4 ct. tw.) — [$4,365](https://www.bluenile.com/wedding-rings/triple-row-east-west-baguette-pave-diamond-wedding-ring-in-14k-white-gold-6-mm-3-4-ct-tw-by-zac-zac-posen-item-193057?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (7 reviews)

The widest and most complex ZZP design in this lineup. Three rows at 6mm total width. East-west oriented baguettes in the center row, flanked by pavé on both sides.

3/4 ct. tw. total diamond weight.

7 reviews — low count for the price, but the design is singular. This is not a quiet wedding band. It is a statement ring that happens to be designed as a band.

